/WalletConfiguration\/IssuanceOptions\/batchSize","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"), or once per Credential"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Request when its jwt proof carries a key attestation, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"again if the issuer refuses the nonce — and a refresh can’t"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"run without the holder. The Secure Enclave"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"enforces it. Off, the app asks for it itself (with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"LAContext.evaluatePolicy","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":") before every presentation — in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the app, from a link, through a document provider extension,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and in person — a check the app’s own code keeps, not the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"key. For Face ID, the app’s Info.plist must have an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"NSFaceIDUsageDescription","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"; without one, iOS asks for the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"passcode instead. A presentation answering several documents"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"at once ("},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityPresentation\/respond(answers:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/MdocPresentation\/respond(answers:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":") asks once: its holder"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"keys share one authentication context for that call only."}],"title":"holderUserPresence"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet":{"title":"OID4VCWallet","abstract":[{"text":"Receive verifiable cre